## request reviewers through GraphQL
POST https://api.github.com/graphql
title: Request reviews
body:
api.github.com
pullRequestId: PR_kwDOAAAA01
userLogins: alice, bob
union: true
s1

## react to a review comment
POST https://api.github.com/repos/acme/app/pulls/comments/1001/reactions
title: React to a review comment
body:
app
content: +1
s1

## turn on auto-merge
POST https://api.github.com/graphql
title: Turn on auto-merge
body:
api.github.com
pullRequestId: PR_kwDOAAAA01
mergeMethod: SQUASH
s1

## add to the merge queue
POST https://api.github.com/graphql
title: Add to the merge queue
body:
api.github.com
id: PR_kwDOAAAA01
sha: 0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef01234567
s1

## remove from the merge queue
POST https://api.github.com/graphql
title: Remove from the merge queue
body:
api.github.com
id: PR_kwDOAAAA01
s1

## approve a pull request with comments
POST https://api.github.com/repos/acme/app/pulls/42/reviews
title: Approve pull request
button: Open PR https://github.com/acme/app/pull/42
body:
app#42
commit_id: 0123456789ab
event: APPROVE
body: Looks good. Rebase before you merge.
comments: [{&#34;body&#34;:&#34;This returns before the deferred close runs.&#34;,&#34;line&#34;:12,&#34;path&#34;:&#34;cmd/ap…
s1

## approve a pull request through GraphQL
POST https://api.github.com/graphql
title: Approve pull request
body:
api.github.com
pullRequestId: PR_kwDOAAAA01
event: APPROVE
s1

## merge a pull request
PUT https://api.github.com/repos/acme/app/pulls/42/merge
title: Merge pull request
button: Open PR https://github.com/acme/app/pull/42
body:
app#42
merge_method: squash
s1

## push one branch
POST https://github.com/acme/app.git/git-receive-pack
title: Push
button: Open branch https://github.com/acme/app/tree/agent/fix-typo
body:
app agent/fix-typo
Change: update refs/heads/agent/fix-typo aaaaaaaaaaaa..bbbbbbbbbbbb
s1

## push two branches
POST https://github.com/acme/app.git/git-receive-pack
title: Push
body:
app agent/fix-typo, agent/update-readme
Change: update refs/heads/agent/fix-typo aaaaaaaaaaaa..bbbbbbbbbbbb
Change: update refs/heads/agent/update-readme aaaaaaaaaaaa..bbbbbbbbbbbb
s1

## delete a branch
POST https://github.com/acme/app.git/git-receive-pack
title: Push
body:
app delete agent/stale
Change: delete refs/heads/agent/stale at aaaaaaaaaaaa
s1

## create a stack of pull requests
POST https://api.github.com/repos/acme/app/stacks
title: Create a stack of pull requests
body:
app
pull_requests: 41, 42, 43
s1

## add to a stack of pull requests
POST https://api.github.com/repos/acme/app/stacks/7/add
title: Add to a stack of pull requests
body:
app stack 7
pull_request: 44
s1

## run a workflow
POST https://api.github.com/repos/acme/app/actions/workflows/1234/dispatches
title: Run a workflow
button: Open workflow https://github.com/acme/app/actions/workflows/1234
body:
app workflow 1234
ref: agent/fix-typo
inputs: {&#34;env&#34;:&#34;test&#34;}
s1

## a REST write that no rule names
POST https://api.github.com/repos/acme/app/check-runs
title: POST /check-runs
body:
app
name: lint
head_sha: 0123456789ab
status: queued
s1

## edit a Notion page
POST https://mcp.example.com/notion
title: Update page
body:
notion
page_id: 00000000000000000000000000000001
command: update_content
content_updates: [{&#34;new_str&#34;:&#34;## Meeting notes&#34;,&#34;old_str&#34;:&#34;## Notes&#34;}]
s1

## create Notion pages
POST https://mcp.example.com/notion
title: Create pages
body:
notion
parent: {&#34;page_id&#34;:&#34;00000000000000000000000000000002&#34;}
pages: [{&#34;properties&#34;:{&#34;title&#34;:&#34;Meeting notes&#34;}}]
s1

## update a Linear issue
POST https://mcp.example.com/linear
title: Save issue
body:
linear
id: APP-12
state: Done
links: [{&#34;title&#34;:&#34;#42 Keep the scroll position after a save&#34;,&#34;url&#34;:&#34;https://github.com/…
s1

## create a Linear issue
POST https://mcp.example.com/linear
title: Save issue
body:
linear
team: Web
title: The settings page loses its scroll position after a save
description: Saving a form scrolls the page back to the top.
s1

## comment on a Linear issue
POST https://mcp.example.com/linear
title: Save comment
body:
linear
issueId: APP-12
body: Fixed in #42.
s1

## sign in to an MCP server
GET https://mcp.example.com/.well-known/oauth-authorization-server
title: GET /.well-known/oauth-authorization-server
body:
mcp.example.com
s1

